## Offers made to you
1. Hannah Boggs has fried_meat and water set out for you at 8 coins — it still stands. To take the whole bundle, call pay_with_item with quote_id 3 and amount 8 — it settles at once. Say your piece in the same breath — pass it in the call's say; don't speak first, because speaking ends your turn and the quote goes unpaid. If you want only part of the bundle, or at another price, don't use that quote_id — make your own offer instead: call pay_with_item with no quote_id, naming the one good you want, its qty, and your coins, one good at a time; they can accept or counter.
Weigh what's in front of you — obligations and pressing needs come before idle matters. Choose one action, then call done() when nothing pressing remains.
